    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Marc - thanks for your reply.  We actually have about 213 plots across which observers sampled roughly 7,000 basins.  There&#39;s an unfortunate lack of consistency in that some plots were visited in all years (2007,2008,2009,2010,2012,2013) and others only visited in 1 or 2.  Similarly basins may have been surveyed across all or only some of the years....does that help?  I&#39;d welcome any suggestions about tests/assessments for determining whether or not there is an issue somewhere in the data or modeling....<div><br></div><div>Thanks again,</div><div>KC</div></div>"
    ],
